{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>面對心頭好，你會否為了省下二十美元而多等十四天？《Buy or Wait Calculator》正是為這種抉擇而設，它不預測價格走勢，而是把金錢與時間的取捨攤開讓你看清楚。現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載，適合時間與價格同樣重要的計劃性購物。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-110.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>輸入三個數字看清取捨</h2>\n<p>Buy or Wait Calculator 並非價格預測工具，不會猜測減價何時出現。你只需輸入今日價格、心中願意支付的價位，以及可接受的等待日數，應用便會把金錢與時間之間的取捨清楚呈現。它適合用於時間與價格同樣重要的計劃性購物，讓你自行判斷省下的金額是否值得等待。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-366-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-367-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-368-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-369-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-370-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Buy or Wait Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/buy-or-wait-calculator/id6804757287?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T2